  "translation": "Mme batho ba Midyane, barekisi, ba feta; ba hula mme ba ntša ⟨את⟩ Yosefa leholeng; mme ba rekisa ⟨את⟩ Yosefa ho ba-Ishmaele ka mashome a mabeli a silifere; mme ba isa ⟨את⟩ Yosefa Mitsrayime.",
